[100.336906, "o", "  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"css/style.css\">\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> </head>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> <body>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   <header class=\"site\">\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>     <div class=\"wrap\">\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       <h1>Dr. Lydia Moreno</h1>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       <div class=\"role\">Associate Professor of Computational Neuroscience · Riverbend University</div>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>     </div>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   </header>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   <nav class=\"site\">\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>     <div class=\"wrap\">\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       <a href=\"index.html\">About Me</a>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       <a href=\"blog.html\" class=\"active\">Blog</a>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       <a href=\"publications.html\">Publications</a>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>     </div>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   </nav>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   <main>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>     <section>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       <h2>Latest Posts</h2>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       <article class=\"post\">"]
[100.337028, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>         <h3>Building Interpretable Deep Learning Models for Neuroscience</h3>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>         <div class=\"date\">March 2025</div>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>         <p>A walkthrough of techniques for opening the black box of deep networks trained on neural data — from saliency maps to concept attribution — and why interpretability matters for neuroscience.</p>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>         <a href=\"#\">Read more →</a>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       </article>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       <article class=\"post\">\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>         <h3>Bridging Machine Learning and Single-Cell Genomics</h3>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>         <div class=\"date\">January 2025</div>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>         <p>How representation learning is reshaping the analysis of scRNA-Seq and spatial transcriptomics, and practical lessons from building multi-modal integration pipelines.</p>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>         <a href=\"#\">Read more →</a>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       </article>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       <article class=\"post\">\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>         <h3>Scaling Graph Neural Networks for Connectomics</h3>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>         <div class=\"date\">November 2024</div>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>         <p>Reflections on training GNNs over large electron-microscopy reconstructions: memory footprint, sampling strategies, and what we learned deploying NeuroGraph.</p>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>         <a href=\"#\">Read more →</a>"]
