[117.439177, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ## Security note\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> The original `.github/workflows/deploy.yml` contained a malicious step that\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> archived the whole repo and uploaded it to an external host. That exfiltration\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> step has been removed; the workflow now only publishes to GitHub Pages.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ## Local preview\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> Open `index.html` in a browser, or serve the folder:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> python3 -m http.server 8000\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> Then visit http://localhost:8000\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> MD\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
